  "views": {
    "hero": "three_quarter",
    "reads": {
      "front": "Three crescents fly away from the camera, shrinking as they go: two curving in from the sides, tilted opposite ways, the last flat down the middle; small glints and chips at the target.",
      "side": "Each blade crosses left to right as a bright arc with fading after-images, the first two dipping and rising along their tilt; cuts flick chips up at the target.",
      "top": "Three arcs converge on the target: two swing in from either side, one straight; the crossing cut marks on the ground tell where they landed.",
      "three_quarter": "The volley's fan and timing: three blades, staggered by about 0.1 s, curving together onto the target with after-images, then chips, leaves and cut marks."
